"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"75199057\"/></p><p><strong>5 Inch High Performance Deep Well Pump</strong><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241012362171894.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/></p><p>We supply 5 Inch High Performance Deep Well Pump 2018 high quality stainless steel 1 year warranty. The sale territory includes more than 70 countries covering Europe, Africa, Asia, South America. We guarantee that our products will win your trust and desire to be your long-term partner. </p><p><strong>1. Product Parameter (specification)</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Brand Name</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">JIADI</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Structure</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Multistage Pump</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Motor Power Type</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Electric</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Volt</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">220V-240V/380-415V</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Speed</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">2850 r/m</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Model Number</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">125QJD15</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Head</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">2-201 m</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Capacity</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">0-23 m3/h</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Motor Power</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">1.1-11kW/ 1.5-15HP</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Motor:</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">oil filled, 100% Copper Wire</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Item Shape</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Round</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Max. Diameter</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">125 mm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Pump Length</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">752mm -2032mm in this series</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Outlet Connection Size</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">2 inches</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Protection Grade</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">IP 68</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Insulation Class</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">F</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Highest temperature water</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">35℃</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Warranty Description</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">1-year limited</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image009.jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241015216881562.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image005(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241012267522165.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/></strong></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Pump Shaft</p><p><img alt=\"image011(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241015559291022.jpg\"/></p><p>·Dia. 17 mm</p><p>·Harder, no distortion</p><p><br/></p></td><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Impeller Intermediate Supporter</p><p><img alt=\"image013(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241016052684855.jpg\"/></p><p>·PC material, anti-high-temperature</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Stator</p><p><img alt=\"image015(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241016159376860.jpg\"/></p><p>·Cold-rolled Silicon steel (#800) with standard pieces</p><p>·Continuous operating guaranteed</p><p><br/></p></td><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Rotor Shaft</p><p><img alt=\"image017(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241016227855122.jpg\"/></p><p>·Super smooth shaft surface can protect the mechanical seal against wearing </p><p>·Extend the lifespan of the mechanical seal and the motor</p><p><br/></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>4. Benefits</strong></p><p>5 Inch High Performance  Deep Well Pump is exactly what you need. This pump delivers a steady 1-23m³/h at its maximum head of 2-201 m when supplied with DC power. Its unique water-tight power connector stops water wicking and prevents potential condensation problems. This product is mainly used in dry region for irrigation of agriculture, domestic use and so on. There is no doubt that our products will bring you the sense of comfort and convenience.</p><p><strong>5. Company Profile</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image019(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241019384600892.jpg\"/></strong></p><p>Located in Wenling, Zhejiang, China, TAIZHOU JIADI PUMP INDUSTRY CO., LTD. is a company focusing on making quality submersible pumps more than 30 years. We always insist on this way and try our best to make \"JIADI\" a world famous brand to contribute to our country.</p><p>Size: 2\", 2.5\", 3\", 3.5\", 4\", 5\", and 6\"</p><p>Voltage: 220V/380V/50Hz</p><p>110V/220V/380V/60Hz</p><p>Power: 0.18kW - 22kW</p><p>Capacity: 0.5m3/h – 60m3/h</p><p>Series: QJ, SR, SP, SK, QGDA, EGDA, EGD, QG, QDX, VSM</p><p>Fluid: clean water, dirty water and thick liquid.</p><p>We will try our best to win your trust and establish steady cooperation with you!</p><p><strong>6. Product Certification</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240909571261840.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image015(001).jpg\"/></p><table><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">ISO14001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">OHSAS18001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">CE</td></tr></tbody></table><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240910014421578.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image017(001).jpg\"/></p><p><br/></p><table><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">GS</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">ISO9001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">RoHS</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br/></p><p>We take pride in the success of our products’ meeting highest quality requirements as stipulated in ISO 9001: 2008, CE, GS, SON, RoHS, PAHS, SNI, etc guidelines and our stringent quality control system.</p><p><strong>7.Exhibition Show</strong></p><p><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241021484524800.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image025(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>8. Packing and Shipping</strong></p><p>Trade terms: FOB,CIF,CFR (CNF),etc</p><p>Payment terms: L/C, D/A, D/P, T/T, Western Union, MoneyGram, PayPal</p><p>Port: Ningbo, Lianyungang, Shanghai</p><p>Lead time: 20-30 days</p><p>Shipment: By sea, by air and by express delivery</p><p>Supply Capability: 100,000 Pieces per Month</p><p>Packing: Carton (with cylinder or foam), wooden box</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241021524200931.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image027(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>9. FAQ</strong></p><p><strong>1. Q: What basic information is needed for selecting a submersible pump?</strong></p><p>A: Flow: How much water will be required for daily use or maximum water need in an hour/minute?And if the well could produce enough water to meet the requirements. Head: What is the vertical dimension from the pump suction chamber to water pipe final outlet?</p><p><strong>2. Are you a manufactory or trading company?</strong></p><p>A: We are water pump manufactory with more than 20 years production experience of solar water pumps.</p><p><strong>3. Q: Do I need to put a check valve in the pipe down to my pump?</strong></p><p>A: Most 4” submersible well pumps are equipped with a check valve in the discharge of the pump. Add an additional check valve for every 100’ or so of drop pipe you use. This can help to break up the water column so that one check valve does not have to hold all the weight of the water.</p><p><strong>4. Q: What's your MOQ?</strong></p><p>A: Sample for testing is available.</p><p><strong><br/></strong><br/></p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: 5 inch high performance deep well pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/5-submersible-pump/5-built-in-submersible-pump-with-float-switch/5-inch-motor-built-in-submersible-pump\"><img alt=\"5 Inch Motor Built-in Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/built-in-submersible-pump-with-float-switch48054138936a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/5-submersible-pump/5-built-in-submersible-pump-with-float-switch/5-inch-motor-built-in-submersible-pump\">5 Inch Motor Built-in Submersible Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/submersible-motor/3-inch-ac-electric-submersible-motor\"><img alt=\"3 Inch AC Electric Submersible Motor\